 "_note_r18": "Ruling 18 parts 4 and 5 (Divit 2026-10-14), qc/paa_gate.py r18 checks. NEW writing only (ruling 15): the AlsoAsked and Semrush candidate pools, the skeleton, feasibility and FAQs of specs never reviewed (no spec.review); a reviewed page's own FAQ is never re-gated by them. near_dup: verb classes (each regex rewritten to its class word) and filler phrases (removed) before the PA9/PA10 same-intent test (JACCARD_DUP). sense_shift: head word -> qualifiers that put it in another sense; PA4 rejects a question carrying the head word and a qualifier unless the page's primary, H1 or slug carries that qualifier. sense_shift_modifiers: a modifier directly before the primary's first two words (Semrush derive only, canary 2026-10-14). named: programs and agencies (whole words, any case), named_upper: the same written in capitals only; state names any case, state_abbr only in capitals (or lowercase directly before the head phrase), never the ambiguous ones in state_abbr_skip; PA16 rejects unless the page itself names it. trivia: PA17 regexes (spelling, translation, citation). drop_shapes: PA6 rejects (navigational, self-quiz; fragment = no question word, for AlsoAsked and Semrush items). acronyms: casing for keyword-sourced questions (skeleton.clean_question) and QC R15.",
